'''Li'l Jamiera Cat''' (ちびネコジャラミ ''Chibi Neko Jarami'', Chibi Jarami Cat) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy first found in [[Tiny Fists (Deadly)|Li'l Titan Awakens!]] He was added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Li'l Jamiera Cat
|image = E 330.png
|appearance = [[Tiny Fists (Deadly)|Li'l Titan Awakens!]]
[[Path to +55|Li'l Cat's Trial]]
|money drop = 2,125¢ - 8,394¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has almost exactly the same stats as the [[Crazed Titan Cat (Enemy)|Crazed Titan Cat]], but there is one catch: his chance to perform a [[Wave Attack]] has been raised from 15% to a whopping '''90%''', thus making it almost GUARANTEED! To make matters worse, he has the same attack animation speed as regular [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]], and you can only use Special and Rare cats against him because of the restriction! You can't hope for the RNG to make it easier for you this time!

==Strategy==
:''For strategy, see [[Tiny Fists (Deadly)]] or [[Path to +55]].

